":"吳王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m011-0057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p011","quote":"吳王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m012-0019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p012","quote":"吳王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p013","quote":"吳王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m013-0183","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p013","quote":"吳王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m020-0060","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p020","quote":"吳王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0062","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p043","quote":"吳王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p025","quote":"吳王濞"}]},{"id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CAA","label":"吳太子被殺未名（吳王濞列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"吳太子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0004","c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0018","c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0049"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p003","quote":"吳太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p003","quote":"吳太子"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0049","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p003","quote":"吳太子"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p003","quote":"孝文時，吳太子入見，得侍皇太子飲博。吳太子師傅皆楚人，輕悍，又素驕，博，爭道，不恭，皇太子引博局提吳太子，殺之。於是遣其喪歸葬。至吳，吳王慍曰：「天下同宗，死長安即葬長安，何必來葬為！」復遣喪之長安葬。吳王由此稍失藩臣之禮，稱病不朝。京師知其以子故稱病不朝，驗問實不病，諸吳使來，輒系責治之。吳王恐，為謀滋甚。及後使人為秋請，上復責問吳使者，使者對曰：「王實不病，漢系治使者數輩，以故遂稱病。且夫『察見淵中魚，不祥』。今王始詐病，及覺，見責急，愈益閉，恐上誅之，計乃無聊。唯上棄之而與更始。」於是天子乃赦吳使者歸之，而賜吳王几杖，老，不朝。吳得釋其罪，謀亦益解。然其居國以銅鹽故，百姓無賦。卒踐更，輒與平賈。歲時存問茂材，賞賜閭里。佗郡國吏欲來捕亡人者，訟共禁弗予。如此者四十餘年，以故能使其眾。"}],"interpretation_note":"依本文子、少子或所事王的太子稱謂保存父子；未記母親。被殺太子與起兵太子分存；少子、起兵太子、子華、子駒彼此是否同人仍待核，不以候選 ID 分立宣稱確證不同人物。 家族分支為候選分配槽，不作出生排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-106","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0004","c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0018","c-shiji-106-wuwang:m003-0049"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-106-wuwang:p003"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-106-wuwang"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji106-003","subject_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CAA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p003","quote":"孝文時，吳太子入見，得侍皇太子飲博。吳太子師傅皆楚人，輕悍，又素驕，博，爭道，不恭，皇太子引博局提吳太子，殺之。於是遣其喪歸葬。至吳，吳王慍曰：「天下同宗，死長安即葬長安，何必來葬為！」復遣喪之長安葬。吳王由此稍失藩臣之禮，稱病不朝。京師知其以子故稱病不朝，驗問實不病，諸吳使來，輒系責治之。吳王恐，為謀滋甚。及後使人為秋請，上復責問吳使者，使者對曰：「王實不病，漢系治使者數輩，以故遂稱病。且夫『察見淵中魚，不祥』。今王始詐病，及覺，見責急，愈益閉，恐上誅之，計乃無聊。唯上棄之而與更始。」於是天子乃赦吳使者歸之，而賜吳王几杖，老，不朝。吳得釋其罪，謀亦益解。然其居國以銅鹽故，百姓無賦。卒踐更，輒與平賈。歲時存問茂材，賞賜閭里。佗郡國吏欲來捕亡人者，訟共禁弗予。如此者四十餘年，以故能使其眾。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"吳太子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依本文子、少子或所事王的太子稱謂保存父子；未記母親。被殺太子與起兵太子分存；少子、起兵太子、子華、子駒彼此是否同人仍待核，不以候選 ID 分立宣稱確證不同人物。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editori